      "statusChangeID": "5bea5b8370d5354914fe858f",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Udon is still very much in active development-- it is a HUGE system, so patience is key. We don't want to release info on features or etc that we aren't 100% on or have to a state we're willing to show off. We will release info when we have things we wish to share in the open.\n\nI do understand the excitement and need for Udon, and the VRChat team is keeping that in mind.\n\nAs this is not a Feature Request, I am Closing this ticket.",
      "viewerReactions": null
